# Flutter Structure

Follow the **UI theme rule** (`ui-theme.mdc`) for all screens — modern card-based layout, pastel data cards, pill controls, dark hero cards.

```
lib/
├── core/          # router, theme, constants, utils
├── features/
│   ├── auth/      # login, signup, onboarding
│   ├── driver/    # dashboard, profile, documents, check_in, expenses, history
│   ├── admin/     # dashboard, drivers, approvals, reports
│   └── vehicles/
├── models/
├── services/      # auth_service, storage_service, supabase_service
└── main.dart
```

## Driver Dashboard (keep simple)

One screen answers: "What did this driver do today?"

- Today's status + Check In button
- Quick actions: Add Earnings, Add Fuel, Add Expense
- Recent days with earnings/fuel/expenses summary

## Daily Log Flow

```
START DAY → select taxi, date, GPS starts → work →
add earnings/fuel/expenses/notes → END DAY → summary shows tracked km
```

## Driver Onboarding (3 steps)

1. Personal info (name, phone)
2. Upload ID + PDP
3. Review → submit → PendingApprovalScreen

## Admin Approval Screen

Show driver info + document previews with Approve/Reject actions. On approve: `profiles.status = approved`.

## Services

- `supabase_service.dart` — client init, queries
- `auth_service.dart` — login, signup, role/status checks
- `storage_service.dart` — upload docs/receipts, signed URL retrieval
